turboexl3_ling builds against the mlx-serve plugin kit and turboexl3 (build.zig.zon, by URL and hash). It vendors
nothing: its routed experts stream over the kit's expert stream (`kit.streamed`), which the kit ships.

src/host_shims.zig is this plugin's code standing in for mlx-serve's C++ shims over MLX's private headers (the kit
stream's event, alloc and launch-cache symbols, served over the server's host table).

ExLlamaV3 (https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3, Copyright (c) turboderp, MIT): the EXL3 format the bank reads
follows exllamav3; no exllamav3 code is shipped. The packed expert record and manifest formats (expert-manifest-v2) are
mlx-stream's (https://github.com/davidtai/mlx-stream, Copyright (c) 2026 David Tai, MIT), which mlx-serve absorbed.

